{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝見た天気予報で今日から1週間くらい晴天って言っていたのでテンションが上がりました₍₍ (ง ˙ω˙)ว ⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日「うたコン」でサイレントマジョリティーを披露させていただきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、石森にじか 小林ゆい 齋藤ふゆか 私の4人で椎名佐千子さんのバックダンサーとしても出演させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで一番緊張したと言ってもいいくらい緊張しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前に4人で手繋いで「頑張ろう!!」って言ってステージに立ちました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日からずっと不安だったけど、無事に終わり安心です(ﾉ_･､)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく貴重な経験が出来てとても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5QQHC1SW8V11NWR32ERXJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5QRM0C33MRCKF8THB6D9C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゆ"}],"source":"archive"}